title: '`pallet-broker`: test `force_reserve` failure at sale rotation'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Covers the `rotate_sale` path where the first free core is beyond `core_count`:
      `ForceReservationFailed` is emitted, `ForceReservations` is drained, and the workload
      is assigned only via the reservation path that `force_reserve` also set up. Test-only.

crates:
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: none
